<title>USA: Western Resources to give update on tender.</title>
<headline>Western Resources to give update on tender.</headline>
<dateline>TOPEKA, Kan. 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Resources Inc said it plans on Monday to announce the number of shares tendered in its offer for Kansas City Power and Light Co and to disclose its intention regarding whether to further extend the offer, which expires on October 25 at 1700 EDT/2100 GMT.</p>
<p>It said its announcement will come before the New York Stock Exchange opens for trade.</p>
<p>On August 30, Western Resources extended its exchange offer for Kansas City Power to October 25 from Septemer 20.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
